<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδιοπομπ-έομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span> (in pass. sense, <i><span class="en">
			Themist.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			4.5
		</span></i>; act. form in <i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			1935.12
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>escort out
				of</i> the city the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῖον
			κῴδιον</span> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῴδιον</span>):
			hence generally, <i>conjure away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				396e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.239
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				15.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽ εὐπρεπείας τοὺς φιλοσόφους ἐκ τῆς
					πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς τοῦδε τοῦ γράμματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>Thras.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>set aside, waive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προβληθέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.401b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theo Sm.
				p.200H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθήρασθαι καὶ ἀ. τὸν οἶκον</span>
			<i>free</i> it <i>from pollution,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				877e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν καθαίρειν καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.53
				</span></i>
			.</div>
